    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d587">

                <pb facs="0568" n="556" xml:id="pg556"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.51A/892: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Iran</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Ford</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-11-11T15:00:00+03:25">November 11,
                            1943—3 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received November 11—1:24 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1056. Medjliss today passed income tax project in its entirety and while a few
                    minor changes were made Millspaugh states that on the whole it is acceptable. He
                    said [<hi rendition="#italic">asked?</hi>] that departure of Shields, Hurst and
                    Breitenbach be expedited.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ford</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
